  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Timor-Leste South Submarine Cable - Timor-Leste - Telecommunications</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The AIFFP is providing advisory support to three stages of the project, which the Government of Timor-Leste is funding. This includes initial development of a Front End Engineering Design to scope cable design and route options and technical and engineering requirements; procurement support to source a turnkey marine vendor; and support to oversight marine cable lay and the design and procurement of cable landing infrastructure. Our project support evolved through project stages to respond to the needs and requests of the Government of Timor-Leste. The project will deliver the first international submarine telecommunications cable to Timor-Leste, enabling ICT-driven economic growth and development through more reliable, quality connectivity between people, business and government across Timor-Leste and the wider Pacific.</narrative>
  </description>
